  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Denmark Nexus Research Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is collaborating with Caritas Denmark and Caritas national organisations on a research initiative looking at localisation implications of the Humanitarian, Development and Peace Nexus. Two studies are planned, and a pooled research budget being established at Caritas Denmark to support this work. One study is planned with Caritas Bangladesh to draw learning from the experience of both Caritas Bangladesh and a wider range of national and international actors in the country with a particular focus on the experience with Nexus funding, coordination and partnership approaches in relation to climate change related emergencies. The study will aim to generate findings and recommendations of relevance both for Caritas member organisations programme quality and learning efforts, but also policy-relevant findings and recommendations to inform the policy and practice of institutional donors (notably the Danish government, the UK government and other major donors in Bangladesh).</narrative>
  </description>
